<title>UK: Thorn to buy back 'B' shrs at 20 1/14p/shr.</title>
<headline>Thorn to buy back 'B' shrs at 20 1/14p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British rentals group Thorn Plc said on Monday it would repurchase all it 'B' shares at a price of 20 1/14 pence each under its capital re-organisation plan.  </p>
<p>The repurchase offer, being implemented by S.G. Warburg, will remain open until August 15, 1997.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
